'''Pumpkin''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon knife]] that was originally obtainable in the [[Halloween Event 2025]] by collecting 6,400 '''[[Candies (2025)|Candies]]''' {{Currency|Candies2025}} and purchasing the 9th tier. It is now only available through trading as the event has since ended.
==Appearance==
This knife is covered in leaves, in various hues of green. There are pumpkins spread around the middle of the knife with a big pumpkin at the bottom.
==Trivia==

* It has a [[Pumpkin Patch (2025)|partner gun]] under a similar name.

